# MoP Classic build. The WoW client auto-loads this _Mists.toc on the Mists of
# Pandaria Classic flavor and the base XalsXpeditedRoutes.toc on retail - same
# folder, one shared Lua codebase.
# MoP Classic interface, current as of patch 5.5.0.x (verified 2026-08-05 via
# warcraft.wiki.gg). If a future patch flags "out of date" again, get the live
# number in-game with: /dump select(4, GetBuildInfo())
## Interface: 50504
## Title: Xal's Xpedited Routes
## Notes: Records gathering positions and displays them on the map and minimap, with an optimal-route compass - combining node-tracking and route optimization into one tool.
## Author: XalaMental
## X-Credits: Concept inspired by node-recording addons GatherMate2/Gatherer and route-optimization addon Routes.
